# Documentation is written by hand and stays that way.
#
# Prettier pads markdown table cells to line up, and its column arithmetic is
# byte-based: the em-dashes and Vietnamese text these docs are full of come out
# misaligned rather than aligned. It also rewrites *emphasis* to _emphasis_.
# Both make a table that reads fine in an editor harder to edit by hand, in
# exchange for nothing a reader ever sees — GitHub renders either identically.
#
# So `npm run format` deliberately leaves docs alone. The rule for prose here is
# the one in CLAUDE.md, not a formatter.
*.md

# Prisma has its own formatter: `npx prisma format`. Prettier does not know the
# schema language and would need a plugin to avoid mangling it.
*.prisma
